# .trivyignore
# Trivy CVE suppression file
#
# RULES:
# 1. Every suppression MUST have a justification comment
# 2. Every suppression MUST have a review due date (max 6 months from entry date)
# 3. No CRITICAL CVEs with available fixes may be suppressed
# 4. Suppressions with expired review dates must be re-evaluated immediately
#
# FORMAT:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # Reason: [why this is suppressed]
#                 # Reviewed by: [name] | Date: YYYY-MM-DD | Due: YYYY-MM-DD
#
# --- Add suppressions below this line only after baseline scan review ---
